; Print the name of an object
;
; Prints the name phrases of the record in IY (its words at +8, +10, +12: see
; #R$9ED6).
;
; IY Record of the object
@label=PrintObjectName
c$9EC7 PUSH IY
 $9EC9 PUSH DE
 $9ECA LD DE,$0008      ; DE = 8, the name phrase codes
 $9ECD ADD IY,DE
 $9ECF CALL $9ED6
 $9ED2 POP DE
 $9ED3 POP IY
 $9ED5 RET
